From: SlicerWeb <noreply@slicer.org>
Subject: [PATCH] COMP: Include iostream where std::cout is used

The logger writes to std::cout and std::cerr without including
<iostream>; other toolchains bring it in through VTK's headers, the
WebAssembly one does not.

---
--- a/SlicerIGSIOCommon/vtkSlicerIGSIOLogger.cxx
+++ b/SlicerIGSIOCommon/vtkSlicerIGSIOLogger.cxx
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
 
 ==============================================================================*/
 
+#include <iostream>
 #include "vtkSlicerIGSIOLogger.h"
 
 // IGSIO includes
